&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Predictions Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Marketing Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building out our Predictions product and are creating a new team to lead our partnerships program. We&#39;re looking for a Predictions Partnerships Lead to own our relationships with the traders and distribution partners that make our predictions markets tradable. This is a highly visible role at the center of our Predictions roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for someone who&#39;s genuinely fluent in how prediction markets work under the hood — trending contracts, liquidity, marketplace dynamics — and who also knows how to hold a real relationship with ecosystem partners. You&#39;ll spend your time identifying prospective partners, leading outreach and relationship-building, and helping turn conversations into active partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high impact role with real ownership. At its core, it&#39;s what you make of it — built for a high agency, mission driven operator who wants to set the strategy, level the team up, and win with a team that actually keeps score.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re chronically online, a builder, or someone who just hates losing, you&#39;ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is required to be in person twice a week at our New York City, NY office.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and evaluate partnership opportunities across predictions ecosystem of market makers, data providers, traders, and distribution partners that expand brand awareness of Gemini’s Predictions product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure partnership terms in collaboration with legal, finance, and compliance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage onboarding, integration and activity of partners in close cross-functional partnership with Engineering, Product, Compliance, and Operations. Act as the escalation point for any issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep, current view of the competitive landscape and translate that into actionable strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of experience in Partnerships, preferably in crypto or an emerging technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building partner programs or ambassador ecosystems from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real fluency with Prediction markets including trading behavior, order books, market-making mechanics, and how liquidity actually gets built on an exchange&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading commercial terms and working with legal/compliance to finalize agreements and onboard new partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — able to size opportunities, track liquidity/volume performance, and make data-informed prioritization calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a fast-paced, evolving regulatory and competitive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
