&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in brokerage or trade operations at a broker-dealer, exchange, or clearing firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the FINRA/SEC regulatory framework applicable to broker-dealers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and reconciliation/analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate or advanced in Excel/GoogleSheets and comfort working within trading and clearing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate skills in SQL and managing large data sets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FINRA Series 99 required (or ability to obtain within 90 days of hire)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FINRA Series 7 and Series 63 preferred&lt;/li&gt;
