&lt;li&gt;The ability to work across teams and time zones, manage dependencies, and handle multiple competing priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
